      "label": "Upper secondary school graduates who commenced post-secondary education within one, three, five or ten years, by sex, programme, responsible organisation, eligibility, grades, national background, and parents´ level of education. Graduation year 2013/2014-2023/2024",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2026-05-26T06:00:00Z",
      "link": {
